# =====================================================================
# Next.js image'iga TUSHMASLIGI kerak boʻlgan fayllar.
#
# Dockerfile'da `COPY . .` bor. Bu fayl boʻlmasa .env.local (maxfiy
# imzo kalitlari), node_modules va butun Bacend/ papkasi (Django
# virtual muhiti bilan birga) image ichiga tushib qoladi.
# =====================================================================

# --- Maxfiy ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
.next/
out/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Boshqa xizmatlar (oʻz image'lari bor) ---
Bacend/
face-service/
app_flutter/

# --- Git / IDE ---
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Hujjatlar va skriptlar ---
*.md
!README.md
*.ps1
deploy.sh
arxiv/
